     1792           run is-page in this-procedure .
     1793           PUT STREAM PrnLibStream string("|Всего по " + temp-doc.cli-name) format "X(29)" "|" at 35 v-sum format "->>>,>>>,>>>,>>>,>>9.99"  "|" at 60 v-sum1 format "->>>,>>>,>>>,>>>,>>9.99" "|" at 85 (v-sum - v-sum1)  format "->>>,>>>,>>>,>>>,>>9.99"   "|" at 110 skip  .
     1794           run is-page in this-procedure .
